# Where waitlist signups are POSTed as JSON: { email, scene, gender, overall, at }
# Anything that accepts a JSON POST works — Formspree, Airtable, a Google Apps
# Script, a Supabase edge function, your own /api route.
#
#   1. Create an endpoint (Formspree is 2 minutes: https://formspree.io)
#   2. Copy this file to .env.local and paste the URL below
#   3. Rebuild — the app starts collecting real people
#
# Leave it unset and the app will NOT pretend anyone joined: the signup card
# falls back to a mailto so nothing is silently lost.
VITE_WAITLIST_URL=
